1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:02,650
He put my best
friend in his pocket.

2
00:00:02,750 --> 00:00:04,670
It's only a fuse, Miss Reyes.

3
00:00:04,670 --> 00:00:06,500
You'll hardly miss him.

4
00:00:06,550 --> 00:00:07,810
Give him back.

5
00:00:07,910 --> 00:00:08,850
No.

6
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:11,350
So I threw a stool
at my landlord.

7
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:14,720
That is coming out
of your deposit.

8
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:17,020
Then the other me lit one word.

9
00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:17,520
Go.

10
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:18,450
He ran.

11
00:00:18,450 --> 00:00:20,040
Past a hundred dead signs.

12
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:22,360
And every one of
them was a name.

13
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:26,310
Careful! Break the ring,
and they all go out.

14
00:00:26,510 --> 00:00:28,380
I only wanted the green one.

15
00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:31,500
Cautious! I was going
to say cautious.

16
00:00:31,590 --> 00:00:33,420
Don't you ever do that again.

17
00:00:33,630 --> 00:00:35,440
Wait. You threw a stool? For me?

18
00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:38,580
And then I saw the
tag on the next fuse.

19
00:00:39,570 --> 00:00:41,020
Mara? That's your mom.

20
00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:44,090
Nine years. And
it was still warm.
